{"generated": "2026-11-13 18:06", "brief": "<b>1. 적대적 M&amp;A 규제 완화 및 시장 활성화 기조</b>\n정부 차원에서 저평가된 주식시장의 구조적 문제를 해결하기 위해 적대적 M&amp;A 활성화 및 관련 규제 전수 조사를 지시했습니다. 대주주 지분이 과도한 기업의 퇴출 가능성까지 언급하며 M&amp;A를 통한 시장 정상화와 주주 가치 제고 의지를 보였습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE5ZLXdtd0Z3ajZwdVEwUDdJSG1BUmVjYTM3cng2SDU5SlFISlBwSU91YnRTc1pNZlE1MG1Yb0diZTkyQm1RSXh3T2xHNF9XRlo5ZWNHS2FzTUREdw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#17</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE5XemtjNHVwUW5NQnRNNGxFMHp0NUE0UW1SWDNJcDBzbk9iOGxEeTExekZ3aWc0LVhVV19aNUVxRkt1UVZHQ0tpeHlTYTVCSGY2UXphSFpYUmJTZw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#18</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTFBZd0psYXFWWDFLS2lwa2hQaTVnc2c3YkhkaHJ6ZF8zbzdnZGt0TzM4VTJUUlNpSWNPUDZRNG5QY0VZbDhpTTRGY1FkUVFRYVBNclE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#23</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE1nYUF0V1A5UzFBMGZ4TUZ1Umpnd0hxZm1yVnBuUTVVV2ZzUERkdnRUN0NLZmdrdGY3amNXMklqbGJ4QkZtaHF4VVUzQXdyVENXb1FaaTRSZGNtMjlPYm5IU0NxQlo5LWJ6Nml5TA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#28</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#30</a>].\n\n<b>2. 구다이글로벌 코스피 상장예비심사 신청 등 IPO 시장 동향</b>\nK뷰티 기업 구다이글로벌이 조선미녀 등의 브랜드를 앞세워 코스피 상장예비심사를 신청하며 증시 입성을 추진합니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE81M2ZmYjNPbnRKU1h3VHZLOEtWZTBiLXlFNklhNlI0cUFuUnNQczhObFlmZU4tRjAtbzB6UEl0MS01b21QMnF5V0thSzcycktfcHB4bk85WWgxWFRQdUtJWkt0TTBDU0ZOWmpQek5rRVBXMUU?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#19</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQaGExbHROTVh5aGxkZHBaa3BBYm1UZl9nQ2hhY2dTeU1adXJacEd3REw2SHczNEZEN191N1BjbmRqUFBXMUIwMXlFNTI3ZV8tU0h4SG9KcGFLVWJJVFN3NURTRVJIM2VLaEFKcUNBY2FHMmV6M2NoZWp4OHRoeXRuSXFJdw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#21</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE1GdEJiWE5NZmpQaXpmQzVUaDYtd0NTTzNkRm9kTncwUmxlQnctTEdFaTQ3SzhXSnNXbFgtR